      "body": "Yes in case of finding service instances using `InstanceIdentifier`, `FindService` with any-semantic is there but i think with `InstanceSpecifier` it is not there.\n\nhttps://github.com/eclipse-score/communication/blob/main/score/mw/com/design/service_discovery/README.md?plain=1#L135C90-L135C108\n\nWith any-semantic support for `InstanceIdentifier` we can get list of instance of same service (`InstanceSpecifier`) . but the API which is rust the goal of that API all the available services on system should be return as a list.",
